pulation=20estimates.=20=20The=20populations=20fluctuate=20in=20response=
=20to=20rainfall.=20=20I=20realise=20we=20should=20have=20done=20a=20pane=
l=20design=20for=20these=20initial=20surveys=20to=20get=20more=20even=20c=
overage=20(the=20animals=20are=20more=20dense=20in=20some=20areas),=20but=
=20too=20late=20now.
